  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《電梯》</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">/李鈺凰（Lí Gio̍k-hông）</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj3x3tw4xOEN-H9AQumQxtks-i16C0fMsTsneJrtXbpRKqDcXmw6npTGKoIBWvGeGLTV16NH7bKSCevId4_GMPK-r82DL7_vgtNWq6DjrekBKEHzQVSehvWvsmPDiciiI0Wdsh9ksP_YVLCKgoHoFJAbqe7STbrX0kz4r0vq349VSeHznLbObTlOG-WQkeB\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj3x3tw4xOEN-H9AQumQxtks-i16C0fMsTsneJrtXbpRKqDcXmw6npTGKoIBWvGeGLTV16NH7bKSCevId4_GMPK-r82DL7_vgtNWq6DjrekBKEHzQVSehvWvsmPDiciiI0Wdsh9ksP_YVLCKgoHoFJAbqe7STbrX0kz4r0vq349VSeHznLbObTlOG-WQkeB=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">落樓　hām你sio辭</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">旅人　遊子　異鄉人</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">規電梯ê恬靜sio-kheh</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">門一下開</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">搧仝一tsūn冷風</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">行向無仝ê暗暝</span></div><div><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>kah lám抱</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">我kan-na一張車票</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: lef